---

NostrXT bundles no third-party code: it is pure LiveCodeScript, it connects
to Nostr relays that you choose and run or trust yourself, and its
cryptography is composed from the sibling suite extensions CoinXT and
SodiumXT (each distributed under its own license with its own third-party
attributions). Published test vectors (BIP-340, NIP-44, BIP-173, NIP-19)
are transcribed into tools/ with their source URLs recorded beside them,
which is attribution enough per the family convention.
